"安裝應用程式後，開啟 **電郵營銷** 應用程式。這會開啟包含不同檢視及篩選選項的"
"郵件儀表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:45
msgid "The following view options are available:"
msgstr "提供以下檢視選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:49
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:68
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/multi_slots.rst:70
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/multi_slots.rst:107
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/event_reporting/attendees_report.rst:78
msgid "List"
msgstr "列表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:51
msgid ""
"The :icon:`reorder` :guilabel:`(List)` view is the default view of the "
":guilabel:`Mailings` dashboard, displaying detailed information about each "
"individual mailing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:54
msgid ""
"By default, information about mailings is shown in the following columns:"
msgstr "預設情況下，郵件相關資料會顯示於以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:56
msgid ":guilabel:`Date`: The date the mailing was sent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:57
msgid ":guilabel:`Subject`: The subject of the mailing."
msgstr ":guilabel:`主旨`：郵件的主旨。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Responsible`: The user who created the mailing, or the user "
"assigned to the mailing."
msgstr ":guilabel:`負責人`：建立該郵件或獲指派處理該郵件的用戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:60
msgid ":guilabel:`Sent`: How many times the mailing has been sent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivered (%)`: Percentage of sent mailings that have been "
"successfully delivered."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已送達 (%)`：已發送郵件中成功送達的百分比。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:63
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Opened (%)`: Percentage of sent mailings that have been opened by"
" the recipients."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已開啟 (%)`：已發送郵件中，被收件人開啟的百分比。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Clicked (%)`: Percentage of sent mailings that have been clicked "
"by the recipients."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已點擊 (%)`：已發送郵件中獲收件人點擊的百分比。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:66
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Replied (%)`: Percentage of sent mailings that have been replied "
"to by the recipients."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已回覆 (%)`：收件人已回覆的已發送郵件百分比。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Status`: The status of the mailing (:guilabel:`Draft`, "
":guilabel:`In Queue`, or :guilabel:`Sent`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`狀態`：郵件的狀態（:guilabel:`草稿`、:guilabel:`佇列中` 或 "
":guilabel:`已發送`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:71
msgid ""
"To add or remove columns, click the :icon:`tune` :guilabel:`(optional "
"columns)` icon at the end of the columns, then select the additional options"
" from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:74
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:48
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/event_reporting/attendees_report.rst:58
msgid "Kanban"
msgstr "看板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:76
msgid ""
"The :icon:`oi_view-kanban` :guilabel:`(Kanban)` view provides a quick "
"overview of mailings, categorized by their current stages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:79
msgid "By default, mailings are categorized into the following stages:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:81
msgid ":guilabel:`Draft`: The mailing is still being written/created."
msgstr ":guilabel:`草稿`：該郵件仍在撰寫／建立中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:82
msgid ":guilabel:`In Queue`: The mailing is scheduled for later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sending`: The mailing is currently being sent to its recipients."
msgstr ":guilabel:`發送中`：系統目前正在將郵件發送給收件人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:84
msgid ":guilabel:`Sent`: The mailing has already been sent to its recipients."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已傳送`：郵件已傳送給收件人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:86
msgid ""
"Each card on the :guilabel:`Mailings` dashboard provides key information "
"about the corresponding mailing. Click the upper corner of the card set a "
"color, :guilabel:`Delete` the mailing, or :guilabel:`Archive` the message "
"for future use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:90
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:98
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/multi_slots.rst:54
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/multi_slots.rst:95
msgid "Calendar"
msgstr "日曆"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:92
msgid ""
"The :icon:`calendar_today` :guilabel:`(Calendar)` view displays each mailing"
" as a clickable entry on the date it was sent or scheduled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:95
msgid ""
"In the side panel, filter the results by :guilabel:`Responsible` user or "
"mailing :guilabel:`Status` via the checkboxes."
msgstr ""
"在側邊面板中，透過核取方塊按 :guilabel:`負責人` 用戶或郵件 :guilabel:`狀態` "
"篩選結果。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:98
msgid ""
"Click any of the entries to :guilabel:`View` the mailing in more detail or "
":guilabel:`Delete` it."
msgstr ""
"點擊任何項目即可 :guilabel:`檢視` 郵件的更多詳細資料，或將其 :guilabel:`刪"
"除`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:104
msgid "Create a mailing"
msgstr "建立群發郵件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:106
msgid ""
"To create a mailing from the *Mailings* dashboard, click the :guilabel:`New`"
" button. A blank mailing form loads."
msgstr ""
"若要從 *郵件* 儀表板建立郵件，請點擊 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕。系統隨即會載入空"
"白的郵件表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:109
msgid ""
"Begin by specifying the :ref:`subject and recipients "
"<email_marketing/recipients>`. Beneath that, the :ref:`Mail Body "
"<email_marketing/mail_body>` and :ref:`Settings "
"<email_marketing/settings_tab>` tabs provide additional configurations to "
"customize the mailing."
msgstr ""
"首先指定 :ref:`主旨及收件人 <email_marketing/recipients>`。下方設有 :ref:`郵"
"件正文 <email_marketing/mail_body>` 及 :ref:`設定 <email_marketing/"
"settings_tab>` 分頁，提供額外配置以自訂郵件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:113
msgid "Mailing form in Email Marketing app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:119
msgid "Subject and recipients"
msgstr "主旨及收件人"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:121
msgid "To start, enter the :guilabel:`Subject` of the mailing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:123
msgid "Then, select one of the following :guilabel:`Recipients`:"
msgstr "然後，選擇以下其中一項 :guilabel:`收件人`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:125
msgid ":guilabel:`Applicant`: Send the mailing to applicants."
msgstr ":guilabel:`申請人`：向申請人發送群發電郵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:126
msgid ":guilabel:`Contact`: Send the mailing to contacts."
msgstr ":guilabel:`聯絡人`：發送郵件給聯絡人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:127
msgid ":guilabel:`Employee`: Send the mailing to employees."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:128
msgid ":guilabel:`Event Registration`: Send the mailing to event attendees."
msgstr ":guilabel:`活動登記`：向活動參加者發送郵件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:129
msgid ":guilabel:`Event Track`: Send the mailing to event track speakers."
msgstr ":guilabel:`活動議程`：向活動議程講者發送郵件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:130
msgid ":guilabel:`Lead`: Send the mailing to leads."
msgstr ":guilabel:`潛在客戶`：將群發郵件發送給潛在客戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:131
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mailing Contact`: Send the mailing to mailing contacts. These "
"contacts can be accessed by navigating to :menuselection:`Email Marketing "
"app --> Mailing Lists --> Mailing List Contacts`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`郵件聯絡人`：向郵件聯絡人發送郵件。要存取這些聯絡人，請前往 "
":menuselection:`電郵推廣應用程式 --> 郵件清單 --> 郵件清單聯絡人`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:133
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mailing List`: Send the mailing to the recipients of the selected"
" :guilabel:`Mailing Lists`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`郵寄清單`：將郵件發送至所選 :guilabel:`郵寄清單` 的收件人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:135
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Point of Sale Order`: Send the mailing to vendors on point of "
"sale orders."
msgstr ":guilabel:`銷售點訂單`：向銷售點訂單上的供應商傳送群發郵件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:136
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Purchase Order`: Send the mailing to vendors on purchase orders."
msgstr ":guilabel:`採購單`：將郵件發送給採購單上的供應商。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:137
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Order`: Ties specifically to the **Sales** app and focuses "
"on a specific sales order in the database."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`銷售訂單`：專門關聯至 **銷售** 應用程式，並針對資料庫中的特定銷售"
"訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:141
msgid ""
"With the default :guilabel:`Mailing List` option selected, a specific "
"mailing list **must** be chosen from the adjacent :guilabel:`Select mailing "
"lists` field drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:144
msgid ""
"Those options (excluding the default :guilabel:`Mailing List`) provide the "
"option to create a more specific recipient filter in the :guilabel:`Domain` "
"field. Optionally, :guilabel:`Dynamic Lists` can be selected to "
"automatically populate the domain."
msgstr ""
"這些選項（預設的 :guilabel:`郵件清單` 除外）讓你可在 :guilabel:`篩選域` 欄位"
"中建立更具體的收件人篩選條件。你亦可選擇 :guilabel:`動態清單`，系統便會自動填"
"入篩選域。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:151
msgid "Mail Body tab"
msgstr "郵件正文分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:153
msgid ""
"In the *Mail Body* tab, select a message template. The template can be "
"modified using the sidebar."
msgstr "在 *郵件內文* 分頁中，選擇一個訊息範本。可使用側邊欄修改該範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:155
msgid ""
"The features on the sidebar used to create and customize emails are "
"separated into three sections: :guilabel:`Blocks`, :guilabel:`Customize`, "
"and :guilabel:`Design`."
msgstr ""
"側邊欄中用於建立及自訂電郵的功能分為三個部分：:guilabel:`區塊`、:guilabel:`自"
"訂` 及 :guilabel:`設計`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:158
msgid ""
"Each building block provides unique features and professional design "
"elements. To use a building block, drag-and-drop the desired block element "
"onto the body of the email being built. Once dropped, various aspects of the"
" building block can be customized."
msgstr ""
"每個建構區塊均提供獨特功能及專業設計元素。要使用建構區塊，請將所需區塊元素拖"
"放至正在建立的郵件正文中。拖放完成後，即可自訂該建構區塊的各項設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:163
msgid ""
"To build an email from the ground up, without any building block elements, "
"select the :guilabel:`Plain Text` template. When selected, Odoo provides a "
"completely blank email canvas, which can be customized in a number of way "
"using the front-end rich text editor that accepts forward slash `/` "
"commands."
msgstr ""
"如要從頭開始建立電郵而不使用任何建置區塊元素，請選擇 :guilabel:`純文字` 範本"
"。選擇後，Odoo 會提供一個完全空白的電郵畫布，並可使用支援正斜線 `/` 指令的前"
"端富文本編輯器，以多種方式進行自訂。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:168
msgid ""
"When `/` is typed into the blank body of the email, while using a "
":guilabel:`Plain Text` template, a drop-down menu of various design elements"
" appears, which can be used to create the desired email design."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:175
msgid "Settings tab"
msgstr "設定分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:177
msgid ""
"The options present in the *Settings* tab of the mail form are divided into "
"three sections: *Email Content*, *Tracking*, and *Advanced*."
msgstr "郵件表單 *設定* 分頁中的選項分為三個部分：*電郵內容*、*追蹤* 及 *進階*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:181
msgid ""
"The options available in the *Settings* tab vary depending on if the "
"*Mailing Campaigns* feature is activated in :menuselection:`Email Marketing "
"--> Configuration --> Settings`. See :ref:`email_marketing/mailing-"
"campaigns` for more information."
msgstr ""
"*設定* 分頁中可用的選項，視乎是否已在 :menuselection:`電郵營銷 --> 配置 --> "
"設定` 中啟用 *郵件推廣活動* 功能而有所不同。請參閱 :ref:`email_marketing/"
"mailing-campaigns` 以了解更多資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:185
msgid "Settings tab on a mailing form in Email Marketing."
msgstr "電郵營銷中郵件表單上的「設定」分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:189
msgid "Email content"
msgstr "電郵內容"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:191
msgid ""
"The *Email Content* section provides the following configuration options:"
msgstr "*電郵內容* 部分提供以下配置選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:193
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Preview Text`: Enter a preview sentence to encourage recipients "
"to open the email. In most inboxes, this is displayed next to the subject. "
"If left empty, the first characters of the email content appear instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:196
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Send From`: Designate an email alias that displays as the sender "
"of this particular email."
msgstr ":guilabel:`寄件人`：指定要顯示為此特定電郵寄件人的電郵別名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:198
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reply To`: Designate an email alias to whom all the replies of "
"this particular email are sent."
msgstr ":guilabel:`回覆至`：指定一個電郵別名，此電郵的所有回覆均會發送至該別名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:200
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Attach a file`: Upload any required (or helpful) "
":icon:`attach_file` :guilabel:`Attachments` on this mailing."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`附加檔案`：在此郵件上載任何所需（或有用）的 :icon:`attach_file` "
":guilabel:`附件`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:204
msgid "Tracking"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:206
msgid "The *Tracking* section includes the following configuration options:"
msgstr "*追蹤* 部分包含以下設定選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:208
msgid ":guilabel:`Medium`: Choose a tracking method (e.g., `Email`, `SMS`)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`媒介`：選擇追蹤方式（例如：`電郵`、`短訊`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:209
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Source`: Choose a source to track (e.g., `Mass Mailing`, "
"`Newsletter`)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`來源`：選擇要追蹤的來源（例如 `群發郵件`、`電子報`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:210
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Responsible`: Designate a user in the database to be responsible "
"for this particular email."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:214
msgid ""
"If the *Mailing Campaign* feature *is* activated, an additional "
":guilabel:`Campaign` field appears in the :guilabel:`Tracking` section of "
"the *Settings* tab."
msgstr ""
"如果*已*啟用*郵件推廣活動*功能，系統會顯示額外的 :guilabel:`推廣活動` 欄位（"
"位於*設定*分頁的 :guilabel:`追蹤` 部分）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:218
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "進階"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:220
msgid "Select the :guilabel:`Keep Archives` option to keep archived mailings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:222
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Allow A/B Testing` option is enabled, different versions "
"of the same mailing are sent to random recipients to gauge the effectiveness"
" of the mailing."
msgstr ""
"如啟用 :guilabel:`允許 A/B 測試` 選項，系統會將同一郵件的不同版本隨機傳送給收"
"件人，以評估郵件的成效。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:225
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`on (#)%` field, specify the percentage of recipients that "
"are sent this current version of the mailing as part of the test. Specify "
"the name of the version in the :guilabel:`A/B Testing Version` field."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`佔 (#)%` 欄位中，指定作為測試一部分而接收此目前郵件版本的收件人"
"百分比。在 :guilabel:`A/B 測試版本` 欄位中，則指定該版本的名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:229
msgid "Beneath that, two additional fields appear:"
msgstr "在該處下方，會顯示兩個額外欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:231
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Winner Selection` field, select the criteria to determine "
"how the final version of the email is selected. The following options are "
"provided:"
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`勝出版本選擇` 欄位中，選取用於決定如何選出電郵最終版本的準則。"
"系統提供以下選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:234
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manual`: Allows the user to determine the \"winning\" version of "
"the mailing. This option removes the :guilabel:`Send Final On` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`手動`：讓用戶自行決定郵件的「勝出」版本。此選項會移除 "
":guilabel:`最終傳送日期` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:236
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Highest Open Rate` (default): The mailing with the highest open "
"rate is determined to be the \"winning\" version."
msgstr ":guilabel:`最高開啟率`（預設）：開啟率最高的郵件會被判定為「勝出」版本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:238
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Highest Click Rate`: The mailing with the highest click rate is "
"determined to be the \"winning\" version."
msgstr ":guilabel:`最高點擊率`：點擊率最高的郵件會被判定為「勝出」版本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:240
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Highest Reply Rate`: The mailing with the highest reply rate is "
"determined to be the \"winning\" version."
msgstr ":guilabel:`最高回覆率`：回覆率最高的郵件會被判定為「勝出」版本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:242
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Leads`: The mailing with the most leads generated is determined "
"to be the \"winning\" version."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:244
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Quotations`: The mailing with the most quotations generated is "
"determined to be the \"winning\" version."
msgstr ":guilabel:`報價單`：產生最多報價單的郵件將被定為「勝出」版本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:246
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Revenues`: The mailing with the most revenue generated is "
"determined to be the \"winning\" version."
msgstr ":guilabel:`收益`：產生最多收益的郵件將被判定為「勝出」版本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:249
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Send Final On` field allows users to choose a date that is "
"used to know *when* Odoo should determine the winning version and send it to"
" the remaining recipients."
msgstr ""
"透過 :guilabel:`最終發送日期` 欄位，用戶可選擇日期，讓 Odoo 知道 *何時* 應確"
"定勝出版本並將其發送給其餘收件人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:252
msgid ""
"Next to these fields is a :guilabel:`Create an Alternative Version` button. "
"When clicked, Odoo opens a new *Mail Body* tab so the user can create an "
"alternate version of the email for testing."
msgstr ""
"這些欄位旁邊設有:guilabel:`建立替代版本`按鈕。點擊後，Odoo 會開啟新的*電郵內"
"文*分頁，讓用戶建立電郵的替代版本以作測試。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:255
msgid "A/B testing settings in the Advanced section of a mailing form."
msgstr "郵件表單「進階」部分的 A/B 測試設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:261
msgid "Mailing templates"
msgstr "郵件範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:263
msgid ""
"To save a mailing as a template for future use, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Email Marketing app --> Mailings` and select a mailing or "
":ref:`create a new one <email_marketing/create-mailing>`. Above the mailing "
"form, click the :icon:`more_vert` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon and select "
":icon:`brush` :guilabel:`Save as Template`."
msgstr ""
"如要將郵件儲存為範本供日後使用，請前往 :menuselection:`電郵推廣應用程式 --> "
"郵件`，選擇現有郵件或 :ref:`建立新郵件 <email_marketing/create-mailing>`。在"
"郵件表單上方，點擊 :icon:`more_vert` :guilabel:`（操作）` 圖示，然後選擇 "
":icon:`brush` :guilabel:`儲存為範本`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:268
msgid ""
"To use a mailing template, navigate to :menuselection:`Email Marketing app "
"--> Templates`. On the *Template Library* page, select the template or its "
":icon:`more_vert` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon, then click "
":guilabel:`Use this` to populate a new mailing form with the configured "
"fields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:273
msgid "Template library in Email Marketing."
msgstr "電郵營銷中的範本庫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:279
msgid "Send, schedule, test"
msgstr "傳送、排程、測試"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:281
msgid ""
"Once the mailing is finalized, proceed to :ref:`Send "
"<email_marketing/send>`, :ref:`Schedule <email_marketing/schedule>`, or "
":ref:`Test <email_marketing/test>` it."
msgstr ""
"郵件定稿後，即可進行:ref:`發送 <email_marketing/send>`、:ref:`排程 "
"<email_marketing/schedule>`或:ref:`測試 <email_marketing/test>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:287
msgid "Send"
msgstr "傳送"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:289
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Send` button reveals a :guilabel:`Ready to unleash emails?` "
"pop-up window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:291
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Send to all` button is clicked, Odoo sends the email to "
"the desired recipients. Once Odoo has sent the mailing, the status changes "
"to :guilabel:`Sent`."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :guilabel:`全部發送` 按鈕後，Odoo 便會向目標收件人發送電郵。Odoo 發送"
"郵件後，狀態會更改為 :guilabel:`已發送`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:297
msgid "Schedule"
msgstr "排程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:299
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Schedule` button reveals a :guilabel:`When do you want to "
"send your mailing?` pop-up window. Click the :guilabel:`Send on` field and "
"select the future date and time on the calendar pop-over. Finally, click the"
" :guilabel:`Schedule` button. The status of the mailing changes to "
":guilabel:`In Queue`."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`排程` 按鈕會顯示 :guilabel:`你希望何時發送郵件？` 彈出視窗。"
"點擊 :guilabel:`發送時間` 欄位，並在彈出日曆中選擇未來的日期及時間。最後，點"
"擊 :guilabel:`排程` 按鈕。郵件的狀態隨即會變更為 :guilabel:`已排隊`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:307
msgid "Test"
msgstr "測試"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:309
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Test` button reveals a :guilabel:`Test Mailing` pop-up "
"window."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`測試` 按鈕會顯示 :guilabel:`測試郵件` 彈出式視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:311
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Recipients` field, enter one or more email addresses of "
"the contacts to whom Odoo should send this test email."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`收件人` 欄位中，輸入一個或多個聯絡人的電郵地址，讓 Odoo 向他們"
"發送此測試電郵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:314
msgid ""
"Once all the desired email addresses have been entered in the "
":guilabel:`Recipients` field, click the :guilabel:`Send Test` button."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`收件人` 欄位輸入所有所需電郵地址後，點擊 :guilabel:`傳送測試` "
"按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:318
msgid ""
"By default, there's a daily limit applied to **all emails** sent across "
"**all applications**. If there are remaining emails to be sent after a limit"
" has been reached, those mailings are **not** sent automatically the next "
"day. The sending needs to be forced by opening the email and clicking "
":guilabel:`Retry`."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，系統對跨**所有應用程式**發送的**所有電郵**均設有每日上限。若達到"
"上限後仍有剩餘電郵待發送，這些郵件在翌日**不會**自動發送。您必須開啟該電郵並"
"按一下:guilabel:`重試`以強制發送。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:323
msgid "Send test pop-up window on a mailing form."
msgstr "郵件表單上的傳送測試彈出式視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:329
msgid "Mailing campaigns"
msgstr "郵件營銷活動"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:331
msgid ""
"In order to create and customize mailing campaigns, the *Mailing Campaigns* "
"feature **must** be activated in the *Settings* page of the **Email "
"Marketing** application. To do that, navigate to :menuselection:`Email "
"Marketing app --> Configuration --> Settings`, click the box beside "
":guilabel:`Mailing Campaigns`, and click the :guilabel:`Save` button."
msgstr ""
"要建立及自訂郵件營銷活動，**必須** 先在 **電郵營銷** 應用程式的 *設定* 頁面啟"
"用 *郵件營銷活動* 功能。請前往 :menuselection:`電郵營銷應用程式 --> 配置 --> "
"設定`，勾選 :guilabel:`郵件營銷活動` 旁邊的方格，然後點按 :guilabel:`儲存` 按"
"鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:336
msgid "Mailing Campaigns feature in the Email Marketing settings."
msgstr "電郵推廣設定中的郵件宣傳活動功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:339
msgid ""
"Once the :guilabel:`Mailing Campaigns` feature is activated, a new "
":guilabel:`Campaigns` menu option appears in the header. The option opens a "
"Kanban view of all mailing campaigns in the database."
msgstr ""
"啟用 :guilabel:`郵件宣傳活動` 功能後，頁首會出現新的 :guilabel:`宣傳活動` 選"
"單選項。該選項會開啟資料庫中所有郵件宣傳活動的看板檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:345
msgid "Create mailing campaign"
msgstr "建立郵件推廣活動"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:347
msgid ""
"To create a campaign, navigate to :menuselection:`Email Marketing app --> "
"Campaigns`. Then, click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"要建立推廣活動，請前往 :menuselection:`電郵推廣應用程式 --> 推廣活動`，然後點"
"擊 :guilabel:`新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:350
msgid ""
"In the new pop-over, specify a :guilabel:`Campaign Name`, a "
":guilabel:`Responsible` user, and :guilabel:`Tags` (if applicable). Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Add` to create the campaign or :guilabel:`Edit` to open a "
"more detailed campaign form."
msgstr ""
"在新的彈出視窗中，指定 :guilabel:`活動名稱`、:guilabel:`負責人` 用戶及 "
":guilabel:`標籤`（如適用）。然後，按一下 :guilabel:`新增` 以建立推廣活動，或"
"按一下 :guilabel:`編輯` 以開啟更詳細的推廣活動表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:354
msgid ""
"At the top of the form, various metric-related smart buttons showcase "
"specific analytics related to the campaign:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:357
msgid ""
":icon:`arrow_selector_tool` :guilabel:`Clicks`: Open a list of recipients "
"who clicked a tracked link in the campaign."
msgstr ""
":icon:`arrow_selector_tool` :guilabel:`點擊次數`：開啟在推廣活動中點擊過追蹤"
"連結的收件人清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:359
msgid ""
":icon:`star` :guilabel:`Opportunities`: Open a list of opportunities or "
"leads generated from the campaign."
msgstr ":icon:`star` :guilabel:`商機`：開啟由該宣傳活動產生的商機或線索清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:361
msgid ""
":icon:`shopping_cart` :guilabel:`Quotations`: Open a list of sales "
"quotations associated with the campaign."
msgstr ""
":icon:`shopping_cart` :guilabel:`報價單`：開啟與該營銷活動相關的銷售報價單清"
"單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:363
msgid ""
":icon:`edit_square` :guilabel:`Revenues`: Open a list of :doc:`journal "
"entries <../finance/accounting/get_started/journals>` tracking transactions "
"related to the campaign."
msgstr ""
":icon:`edit_square` :guilabel:`收益`：開啟一份:doc:`日記賬記項 <../finance/"
"accounting/get_started/journals>`清單，以追蹤與該推廣活動相關的交易。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:367
msgid ""
"If the Odoo **CRM** *Leads* feature is enabled, the :icon:`star` "
":guilabel:`Opportunities` shows up as :icon:`star` :guilabel:`Leads`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:370
msgid "Additionally, the following buttons appear:"
msgstr "此外，亦會顯示以下按鈕："

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:372
msgid ""
":guilabel:`New Mailing`: Create a :ref:`new mailing <email_marketing/create-"
"mailing>`."
