msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:374
msgid ""
":guilabel:`New Post`: Create a new :doc:`social media post "
"<social_marketing/social_posts>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`新增貼文`：建立新的 :doc:`社交媒體貼文 <social_marketing/"
"social_posts>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/email_marketing.rst:375
msgid ""
":guilabel:`New Push`: Create a new :ref:`push notification "
"<social_marketing/social_posts/push-notifications>` for social media posts."
