msgid ""
":guilabel:`Talks`: :ref:`View a schedule <events/talks-proposals-"
"agenda/view-talks>` of all tracks scheduled for the event, listed by date."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`講座`：:ref:`查看時間表 <events/talks-proposals-agenda/view-talks>"
