#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/track_manage_talks.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Agenda`: :ref:`View a calendar <events/talks-proposals-"
"agenda/view-agenda>` of all scheduled tracks for the event, showing detailed"
" times for each date."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`議程`：:ref:`檢視日曆 <events/talks-proposals-agenda/view-agenda>"
