":guilabel:`Sub-menu (Specific)` setting. Finally, click :guilabel:`Save` to "
"apply changes."
msgstr ""
"為此，請點擊頂部的 :guilabel:`編輯` 按鈕。在編輯器面板中，點擊頂部的 "
":guilabel:`自訂` 分頁，然後啟用 :guilabel:`子選單（特定）` 設定。最後點擊 "
":guilabel:`儲存` 以套用變更。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/track_manage_talks.rst:51
msgid "View talks"
msgstr "查看演講"

