msgstr " *演講* 頁面會顯示活動已規劃議程的日程表，並按日期排序。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/track_manage_talks.rst:55
msgid ""
"Visitors can mark a track as a *Favorite* by clicking the :icon:`fa-bell-o` "
":guilabel:`(empty bell)` icon to the right of the track title. A track "
