"心鈴鐺）` 圖示。訪客之後便可以 :ref:`按最愛篩選議程 <events/talks-proposals-"
"agenda/filter-favorites>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/track_manage_talks.rst:60
msgid ""
"Additionally, visitors can also :ref:`filter tracks by their tags "
"<events/talks-proposals-agenda/filter-tags>` (customized on each track's "
"form)."
