":guilabel:`Favorites` drop-down, allowing users to filter tracks by tag "
"categories."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/track_manage_talks.rst:94
msgid ""
"To add tags and tag categories to track forms, navigate to the **Events** "
"app and open the desired event. Click the :icon:`fa-microphone` "
":guilabel:`Tracks` smart button and open the desired event track."
