#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/track_manage_talks.rst:98
msgid ""
"On the track form, type a new tag in the :guilabel:`Tags` field. Then, click"
" :guilabel:`Create and edit...` from the resulting drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"在活動場次表單上，於:guilabel:`標籤`欄位輸入新標籤，然後在顯示的下拉式選單中"
"點擊:guilabel:`建立並編輯...`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/track_manage_talks.rst:101
msgid ""
"Doing so reveals a :guilabel:`Create Tags` pop-up form with the following "
"fields:"
msgstr "執行此操作會顯示一個 :guilabel:`建立標籤` 彈出式表單，當中包含以下欄位："

