"related data and analytics. These reports can either be focused on "
"*Attendees* or *Revenues*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/event_reporting/revenues_report.rst:8
msgid ""
"The following documentation focuses on the reporting options related to "
"event *Revenues*."
msgstr "以下說明文件重點介紹與活動 *收益* 相關的報告選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/event_reporting/revenues_report.rst:11
msgid "Revenues reporting page"
msgstr "收益報告頁面"

