#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/understanding_metrics.rst:74
msgid "Traces"
msgstr "追蹤記錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/understanding_metrics.rst:76
msgid ""
"Odoo records each participant's history at each step (activity) of a "
"campaign workflow. These *traces* are accessed by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Marketing Automation app --> Reporting --> Traces`. By "
"default, this opens a *Traces* report displaying a :icon:`fa-toggle-on` "
":guilabel:`Stacked` :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`(Bar Chart)` of the "
"total :guilabel:`Count` of participants for each scheduled action."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 會記錄每位參與者在推廣活動工作流程每個步驟（活動）的歷程。要存取這些 *追"
"蹤紀錄*，可前往 :menuselection:`自動化推廣應用程式 --> 報告 --> 追蹤紀錄`。預"
"設情況下，這會開啟 *追蹤紀錄* 報告，以 :icon:`fa-toggle-on` :guilabel:`堆疊` "
":icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`（棒形圖）` 顯示每個已排程動作的參與者總 "
":guilabel:`計數`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/understanding_metrics.rst:82
msgid "The Traces page in the Odoo Marketing Automation application."
msgstr "Odoo 營銷自動化應用程式中的「追蹤記錄」頁面。"

