msgid ":guilabel:`Header`: Enter the main header text."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sub-Header`: Enter a sub-header text, displayed above the header."
msgstr ":guilabel:`副標題`：輸入副標題文字，顯示於標題上方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Section`: Enter a text to be displayed in the lower section."
msgstr ":guilabel:`區段`：輸入要在下方區段顯示的文字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:79
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sub-section 1`: Enter a text to be displayed below the lower "
"section."
msgstr ":guilabel:`子部分 1`：輸入要顯示在下方區域的文字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sub-section 2`: Enter a text to be displayed next to "
":guilabel:`Sub-section 1`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`子章節 2`：輸入要顯示在 :guilabel:`子章節 1` 旁邊的文字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:81
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dynamic Image 1`: Select an existing image from the selected "
"recipient's model to be displayed in a corner of the card. This field only "
"takes a :ref:`dynamic placeholder <marketing_card/create-campaign/card-"
"layout/dynamic-placeholders>` as input."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`動態圖片 1`：從所選收件人的模型中選取現有圖片，以顯示於卡片的角落"
"。此欄位僅接受 :ref:`動態佔位符 <marketing_card/create-campaign/card-layout/"
"dynamic-placeholders>` 作為輸入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:84
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dynamic Image 2`: Select an existing image from the selected "
"recipient's model to be displayed in a corner of the card. This field only "
"takes a :ref:`dynamic placeholder <marketing_card/create-campaign/card-"
"layout/dynamic-placeholders>` as input."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`動態圖片 2`：從所選收件人的模型中選取現有圖片，以顯示在卡片的其中"
"一角。此欄位只接受 :ref:`動態佔位符 <marketing_card/create-campaign/card-"
"layout/dynamic-placeholders>` 作為輸入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:87
msgid ":guilabel:`Button`: Enter a text for the button."
msgstr ":guilabel:`按鈕`：輸入按鈕文字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:89
msgid ""
"A preview of the resulting card allows the user to interactively visualize "
"their configuration. Above the preview are selectable themes to change the "
"appearance of the card."
msgstr ""
"所得卡片的預覽可讓使用者以互動方式檢視其配置效果。預覽上方設有可選取的主題，"
"用於更改卡片的外觀。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:93
msgid ""
"The following fields allow users to configure the translations of the "
"inputted text into all other :doc:`available languages "
"<../general/users/language>` in the database:"
msgstr ""
"以下欄位讓用戶設定將輸入文字翻譯成資料庫中所有其他 :doc:`可用語言 <../"
"general/users/language>`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:96
msgid ":guilabel:`Header`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`標頭`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:97
msgid ":guilabel:`Sub-Header`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`副標題`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:98
msgid ":guilabel:`Section`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:99
msgid ":guilabel:`Sub-Section 1`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`子章節 1`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:100
msgid ":guilabel:`Sub-Section 2`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`子章節 2`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:102
msgid ""
"To do so, click :guilabel:`EN` at the edge of the field. In the resulting "
"pop-up window, make any modifications to the translations. Finally, click "
":guilabel:`Save` to save or :guilabel:`Discard` to cancel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:109
msgid "Dynamic placeholders"
msgstr "動態預留位置"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:111
msgid ""
"By default, the text content of each field is static. However, the fields "
"listed (except for :guilabel:`Background` and :guilabel:`Button`) can also "
"be populated automatically using :ref:`dynamic placeholders "
"<email_template/dynamic-placeholders>` to personalize the card content for "
"different recipients."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，每個欄位的文字內容均為靜態。不過，所列欄位（:guilabel:`背景` 及 "
":guilabel:`按鈕` 除外）亦可使用 :ref:`動態佔位符 <email_template/dynamic-"
"placeholders>` 自動填入內容，為不同收件人個人化卡片內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:116
msgid ""
"To do this, click the checkmark next to the field. Then, browse and select a"
" placeholder value to be populated from the selected recipient."
msgstr ""
"要執行此操作，請按一下欄位旁邊的剔號。然後，瀏覽並選擇要從所選收件人自動填入"
"的佔位符數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:122
msgid "Recipient Message tab"
msgstr "收件人訊息分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:124
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Recipient Message` tab on the campaign form provides options "
"to configure messages sent to recipients when sharing the card."
msgstr ""
"推廣活動表單上的 :guilabel:`收件人訊息` 分頁提供選項，讓您設定分享卡片時傳送"
"給收件人的訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:127
msgid "Users can configure the following fields:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:129
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Request`: Enter a request to be displayed at the top of the "
"campaign."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:130
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Request Description`: Enter a description of the request, "
"displayed below the request."
msgstr ":guilabel:`請求說明`：輸入請求的說明，該說明會顯示於請求下方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:131
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reward Link`: Provide a link to reward recipients who share the "
"campaign."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:132
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Thank You Message`: Enter a message to thank recipients for "
"sharing the campaign."
msgstr ":guilabel:`感謝訊息`：輸入感謝收件人分享推廣活動的訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:134
msgid ""
"Recipient Message tab in the card campaign form in Odoo Marketing Card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:140
msgid "Preview campaign"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:142
msgid ""
"Once the card campaign form has been configured, click the "
":guilabel:`Preview` button to view a copy of a campaign to be sent to "
"recipients."
msgstr ""
"設定好卡片推廣活動表單後，點按 :guilabel:`預覽` 按鈕，即可查看將發送予收件人"
"的推廣活動副本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:145
msgid ""
"The campaign layout is organized with the request and the request "
"description displayed at the very top, followed by the card, then a list of "
"social media icons allowing the user to share the campaign across different "
"platforms."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:149
msgid "Preview of a card campaign in Odoo Marketing Card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:155
msgid "Campaign mailing"
msgstr "推廣活動群發郵件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:157
msgid ""
"After configuring a card campaign, users can :ref:`configure mailing options"
" <marketing_card/mailing/configure>` then :ref:`share the cards "
"<marketing_card/mailing/send>` with recipients."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:164
msgid "Configure mailing"
msgstr "配置郵件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:166
msgid ""
"To configure the campaign mailing, click :guilabel:`Send`. On a separate "
"page, users configure the :ref:`email form <email_marketing/create-mailing>`"
" to filter or specify recipients and customize the body of the message."
msgstr ""
"要配置推廣活動郵件，請點擊 :guilabel:`發送`。在另一頁面上，用戶可配置 "
":ref:`電郵表單 <email_marketing/create-mailing>` 以篩選或指定收件人，並自訂訊"
"息正文。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:170
msgid ""
"Send Cards window when sending mailing campaigns in Odoo Marketing Card."
msgstr "在 Odoo 營銷卡片發送郵寄推廣活動時的發送卡片視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:173
msgid ""
"To start, enter the subject of the mailing in the :guilabel:`Subject` field."
msgstr "首先，在:guilabel:`主旨`欄位中輸入郵件主旨。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:175
msgid ""
"Next, under the :guilabel:`Card Language`, select the language in which to "
"render the cards."
msgstr "接著，在:guilabel:`卡片語言`下方，選擇用於呈現卡片的語言。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:177
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Card Campaign` and :guilabel:`Recipients` fields are already "
"populated. The filtering rule under the :guilabel:`Recipients` field can be "
"modified to update the mailing list."
msgstr ""
"系統已預先填寫 :guilabel:`卡片推廣活動` 及 :guilabel:`收件人` 欄位。你可修改 "
":guilabel:`收件人` 欄位下的篩選規則，以更新郵寄清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:180
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Mail Body` tab is automatically populated with a default "
"message along with the card. This message can be modified using the website "
"editor."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:183
msgid ""
"After configuring the email form, click the :guilabel:`Update (#) Cards` "
"button to generate or update the personalized cards for each recipient. "
"Then, on the :guilabel:`Confirm Cards Update` pop-up window, click "
":guilabel:`Update Cards` to create a draft mailing, or click "
":guilabel:`Cancel` to cancel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:189
msgid "Alternatively, clicking :guilabel:`Save` also creates a draft mailing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:194
msgid "Send cards"
msgstr "發送卡片"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:196
msgid ""
"Once the cards have been updated, users can either send the cards or "
"schedule the mailing for a future date."
msgstr "更新卡片後，用戶可直接發送卡片，或排程於日後發送。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:199
msgid ""
"To send the mailing, navigate to :menuselection:`Marketing Cards --> "
"Campaigns`, select the campaign, then click the :icon:`fa-envelope` "
":guilabel:`Mailings`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:202
msgid ""
"Next, select the mailing and click :guilabel:`Send`. On the :guilabel:`Ready"
" to unleash emails?` pop-up window, click :guilabel:`Send to all` to send "
"the cards to the specified recipients."
msgstr ""
"接著，選擇該郵件並點擊 :guilabel:`發送`。在 :guilabel:`準備好發送電郵了嗎？` "
"彈出視窗中，點擊 :guilabel:`全部發送`，將卡片發送給指定收件人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:205
msgid ""
"Alternatively, to schedule for a later date, click :guilabel:`Schedule`. On "
"the pop-up window, select a date in the :guilabel:`Send on` field. Finally, "
"click :guilabel:`Schedule` to schedule the mailing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:209
msgid ""
"After sending or scheduling a mailing campaign, a series of smart buttons "
"appear, showing the :doc:`engagement metrics "
"<email_marketing/analyze_metrics>` for the campaign."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:217
msgid ""
"At any point, users can view metrics about the campaign, displayed as smart "
"buttons at the top of the campaign form."
msgstr ""
"用戶可隨時查看宣傳活動的指標，這些指標會以智能按鈕的形式顯示在宣傳活動表單頂"
"部。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_card.rst:220
