":guilabel:`Campaigns` dashboard, click :guilabel:`Add a Column`, enter in "
"the desired information, and click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/social_marketing/social_campaigns.rst:52
msgid ""
