"按鈕位於 :guilabel:`營銷活動` 儀表板左上角。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/social_marketing/social_campaigns.rst:69
msgid ""
"Both options reveal a new campaign detail window directly on the "
":guilabel:`Campaigns` dashboard when clicked."
